# private Gradle homes of the parallel agents
# Private Gradle homes of the porting lanes. Each agent runs with its own
# GRADLE_USER_HOME so the shared Loom cache cannot be corrupted by concurrent builds.
# They belong to nobody but their lane and must never be committed: an earlier wave
# committed a 1.1 GB one and it had to be filter-repo'd out of history.
.gradle-*/
.gradle-surv/
.gradle-float/
.gradle-f3/
